<span class="printed" data-width="103.853" style="left:76.346px;top:959.156px;font-size:13.333px;font-weight:400;color:#000000">신 청 인  :  주    소</span>
<span class="printed" data-width="48" style="left:140.346px;top:977.823px;font-size:13.333px;font-weight:400;color:#000000">기업체명</span>
